<div id="2026-11-13-recipe-form-ai" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-11-13 — Recipe add and edit use the shared AI assistant</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Health Kitchen now has an add and edit recipe form at <code>/healthkitchen/recipe_form</code>. It includes the same AI assistant as the other record forms, with the ency agent. The recipes list links to Add recipe.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> There was no recipe add or edit form, so the assistant had nowhere to sit. A recipe is a plant and food record, so it uses the same path as the encyclopedia forms.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Comserv/lib/Comserv/Controller/HealthKitchen.pm</code>, <code>Comserv/lib/Comserv/Util/HealthKitchen.pm</code>, <code>Comserv/root/healthkitchen/recipe_form.tt</code>, <code>Comserv/root/healthkitchen/recipes.tt</code></p>
</div>
